{
  "title": "Creating a Poly Item Item Type",
  "html": "<html><head></head><body><div>\n  <h1>Creating a Poly Item Item Type</h1>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\">Use the following procedure:</p>\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; \n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n    <ol>\n      <li class=\"Numbered\">In the Navigation pane, click&nbsp;<span class=\"MenuChoice\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Administratio</span><span class=\"MenuChoice\">n</span>&gt;<span class=\"MenuChoice\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">ItemType</span>. The following menu appears:</li>\n    </ol>\n    <p class=\"Figure_indented\" style=\"margin-left: 50px;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/aras-images/itemenu.jpg\"></p>\n    \n    <ol start=\"2\">\n      <li class=\"Numbered\">Click <strong>Create New ItemType</strong>. An blank ItemType window appears.</li>\n    </ol>\n    <p class=\"Figure_indented\" style=\"margin-left: 50px;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/aras-images/blankitem.jpg\"></p>\n    <ol start=\"3\">\n      <li class=\"Numbered\">Enter data for the header properties of your new Item Type, selecting <strong>Poly Item</strong> for the implementation type.</li>\n    </ol>\n    <p class=\"Content_body_indented\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/aras-images/implement.jpg\"></p>\n    <!--?rh-list_start level=\"1\" an=\"1\" class=\"rl-p-Figure_indented\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; \n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n      <p class=\"Figure_indented\">You will receive the following warning. &nbsp;</p>\n      <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n        <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; \n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n          <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n            \n            <p class=\"Content_body_indented\"><img src=\"/aras-images/ploywarn.jpg\"></p>\n            <!--?rh-list_start level=\"1\" an=\"1\" class=\"rl-p-Figure_indented\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; \n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n              <p class=\"Figure_indented\">Note that many of the relationship tabs are disabled when selecting the Poly Item type</p>\n              <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n                <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n                  <ol start=\"4\">\n                    <li class=\"Numbered\">Click&nbsp;<strong>OK</strong>.</li>\n                    <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n                      <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; \n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n                        <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n                          <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; \n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n                            <li class=\"Numbered\">Click the “Poly Sources” relationship tab &nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n                  </ol>\n                  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n                    \n                    <p class=\"Content_body_indented\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"80\" src=\"/aras-images/polytab.jpg\" width=\"848\"></p>\n                    <!--?rh-list_start level=\"1\" an=\"1\" class=\"rl-p-Figure_indented\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; \n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n                      <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n                        <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; \n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n                          <ol start=\"6\">\n                            <li class=\"Numbered\">Select existing ItemTypes that the Poly Item will support. For example, the following could be a list for the Deliverable Item Type.</li>\n                          </ol>\n                          <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n                            \n                            <p class=\"Content_body_indented\"><img src=\"/aras-images/polyrel.jpg\"></p>\n                            <!--?rh-list_start level=\"1\" an=\"1\" class=\"rl-p-Figure_indented\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; \n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n                              \n                              <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n                                <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; \n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n                                  \n                                  <ol start=\"7\">\n                                    <li class=\"Numbered\">Select the <strong>Properties </strong>tab. &nbsp;Enter any common property names that you would like to display in selection search item browser grids. &nbsp;If a property name is added that does not exist in all the Poly Sources,\n                                      then an error similar to the following will be thrown when saving the ItemType.</li>\n                                  </ol>\n                                  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n                                    <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; \n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n                                      <p class=\"Content_body_indented\" style=\"margin-left: 50px;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/aras-images/miloerror.jpg\"></p>\n                                      <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n                                        <!--?rh-list_start class=\"rl-p-Figure_indented\" level=\"1\" an=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; \n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n                                          \n                                          <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n                                            <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; \n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n                                              <ol start=\"8\">\n                                                <li class=\"Numbered\">Click &nbsp;<img src=\"/aras-images/done.jpg\">&nbsp; &nbsp;to save and unclaim the item.</li>\n                                              </ol>\n                                              <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n\n</div></body></html>",
  "sourceFile": "creating_a_poly_item_item_type.htm"
}